<section class="wrap sec sec--narrow" aria-labelledby="faq">
  <h2 id="faq" class="h2">Questions</h2>
  <dl class="faq">
    <div><dt>What happens when the trial ends?</dt><dd>If you don’t subscribe, your account turns read-only. You can still open every job and download every PDF and CSV. Nothing is deleted.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Is there a contract?</dt><dd>No. Cancel from the billing page whenever you want. A yearly plan runs to the end of its year.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Does my customer need an account?</dt><dd>No. They sign on your phone, or open the link you send them and sign there.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Can I call it a work authorization instead?</dt><dd>Yes. Pick “change order” or “work authorization” in your settings and every document uses that name.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</section>

